  "repair_or_experiment_note": "# Human switch to original SCUT PPO for MOD4 standing200\n\nHuman instruction on 2026-11-03: “现在完全按照华南虎的站着上台阶开源来搞”. This supersedes the custom RL+BPTT method and frozen unused V17. Historical sources, failed checkpoints, once markers and trial tags remain intact.\n\nPinned official source is scutrobotlab/wheeled-legged_RL commit `1a26356d6f591734d4f6f666f5cead1a6925da67`. The author-recommended rough_rotation_stair/2026-07-23_16-23-21 recipe starts with weights from flat_and_rotation/2026-07-19_09-14-50/model_8000.pt, with resume_training false. The selected route is fresh seed66 MOD4 flat PPO toward8000 iterations, then weights-only rough transfer and fresh rough-stage Adam. Finite windows continue complete learning state until the flat boundary is actually reached. No imported old BPTT actor, teacher or optimizer.\n\nThe source uses ordinary PPO, actor35/critic78,256/128/64ELU,24steps,5epochs/4minibatches,GaussianSTD1,lr1e-4 adaptiveKL.01,gamma.99,lambda.95,clip.2,entropy.005,maxgrad1. Flat and rough preserve their different value coefficients4/2 and reward coefficients; neither enables state machines or wheel-forward scanning. Original saved terrain generator/terrain command profiles are retained. Its stair increments5–40mm are not a published dedicated200mm success protocol. Video/checkpoint identity is not established. Independent200mm acceptance remains required.\n\nMOD4-specific adaptations are explicit: enhanced MOD4v1USD/contract,6motor mapping, no SCUT gimbal, MOD4 valid closed-chain reset bank, original PD/DC and D0–D7,400Hzphysics/100Hzfeedback/50Hzpolicy,.0025sTGS32/4,10mmclosure and.01radmimic singleepisode resets. Source robot-specific predefined reset poses cannot be copied across mechanisms. The source algorithm/reward/commands are retained; this is not a claim of identical SCUT physical robot reproduction.\n\nLocal CPU attempts1–3 failed for dependencies, extraction metadata or an incorrect fixture assumption and remain preserved. Attempt4 passes actual RSL5 synthetic24rollout/PPO/fullAdamlearningrestore and supported-ascent acceptance tests. The adapter CPU test checks original flat/rough values and boundary functions. None of these are physical skill results.\n\nResource entryA was rejected locally by an old marker collision before network; no old once was consumed again. EntryB checked allfour4090:72twoempty/210emptybutdiskinsufficient/86occupied. Parent fresh canonical/private/shared locks were checked before each admitted start. Original strictreserve86412.86069250107 and unique original canonical remain unchanged. Each window is3900total/save3600/exit300; no copied/refunded/increasedbudget.\n\nV18 launched but failed before environment construction: the source flat YAML has height_scanner=None while the reused SDK expected a descriptor. V19 separately disables that scene sensor and uses original flat groundz0. V19 reached real4096environment startup/reset, then the first control encountered the old MOD4 straight-only yaw assertion. Neither completed a PPO update. Both original owners waited, settled cost, closed the SDK and released leases. Raw errors and interrupted files are preserved.\n\nV20 changes only that obsolete straight-only audit assertion to accept the original SCUT rotation command distribution. AST-based adaptation preserves scriptedactionhook/step event/superphysicalstep and repairs its zero-argument super class cell; a CPU fixture exercises nonzero yaw and that call order. Prior frozen source is referenced by path/SHA, with small new overrides. No active shared source is patched.\n\nActual V20 GO:2026-11-03T23:14:41.529600+08:00; save2026-11-04T00:14:41.529600+08:00; nominal2026-11-04T00:19:41.529600+08:00. Run MOD4_STANDING200_SCUT_RECIPE_V20_FLAT_1793718811682640300 on72GPU-16828f91-2b45-b646-8dc0-9481138e2842. Owner1549188/create1793718880.82 and worker1549198/create1793718881.82 exactexe/argv are in actual receipts, with initialPopenbash distinguished from Pythonafterexec.\n\nActual FIRST completes24controls/192physicsticks/98304ownonpolicysamples,1PPOiteration and20Adamsteps. Actornorm.1655807793/criticnorm1 finite nonzero. Full checkpoint8927129B SHAa767d8b84ffa34c4424095945f0f0240de66bd0452306227ba800db0fe2a1fa4. These are algorithm/startup evidence only, not200mmskill.\n\nThe same finite owner performs full finalsave, safe close/cost settlement, then independent80firstepisodes10sseed9137 on a separate200mmcourse. Acceptance needs wholewheel footprints, actual400Hz both-wheel topcontact,0.5sstable velocity/attitude, no ground/edge return, and no unsupportedgap>.10s; chassis/guide support is allowed and flight is not required. All80actualmanifold and selectedbodyposes/curves are saved. After actualOWNER_EXIT and localcontrollerrelease, control.py closed transfers immutable evidence once; scut_recipe_v18/render.py renders savedposes from authoredUSD with no neural/physicsstep, then current-modelnativeview_image/curves decide continuation. The existing hourly automation now follows this source method and currentworkorder. No newchat/goal/automation or other270mmscope operations.\n\nAll source/error/report/once/automation snapshots are indexed by realSHA; prior identical text references its originalGitobject. Weights/NPZ/USD/media remain external with publishedpath/size/SHA; no productionmodel is read for archive. No standing200success is claimed.\n",
